<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">
<span class="c11">Valor Points for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</span></h3>For this Phase there is no longer any Tier available for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, making how you want to spend them less streamlined. The list below is based on having full Best in Slot gear from Firelands, if you're missing a piece from Firelands it is very likely that if any of the items below can cover that slot it will be a better upgrade for you. <br/>
<i>
<b>The general rule is the higher Stamina/<wbr/>Agility gained for the slot, the higher priority</b> (without losing any set bonuses of course)</i>.<br/>
<a href="https://wowsims.github.io/cata/druid/guardian/" target="_blank">WoWSims</a> is also an invaluable tool when comparing different items!<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77173/rooftop-griptoes">
